{"pageId":"a73d0bad-ce48-4de7-b01c-afb21d0cb465","pageCanonId":"4101047f-0a57-42f9-b537-2f1dcd7d1fa7","title":"概览（Overview）","slug":"overview","headerTitle":"概览","description":"无障碍设计让不同能力水平的用户都能浏览、理解 UI 并从中获得乐趣","headerAlignment":"LEFT","isDescriptionVisible":true,"updatedTimestamp":"2026-07-17T05:27:26.725Z","headerImageUrl":"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/design-spec/o/projects%2Fm3%2Fimages%2Fmrodc2bu-Accessibility.png?alt=media&token=d5a7c848-c96f-41ce-b600-faa98228e21d","sections":[{"pageSectionId":"de49aaef-8f58-4719-9af6-34a5687a295a","pageSectionCanonId":"39dde494-13ff-491d-b53e-d59094a8f759","name":"原则","position":0,"pageId":"2bf18b74-cba2-46ff-8fe0-f54c752943f6","pageCanonId":"4101047f-0a57-42f9-b537-2f1dcd7d1fa7","isVisible":true,"contentBlocks":[{"pageContentBlockId":"ef34ced5-b57f-4df5-a684-660f130d0f7e","pageContentBlockCanonId":"25cda2a6-e748-4efc-be27-8be7b1966fc5","isHidden":false,"isSqueezed":false,"title":null,"pageSectionId":"de49aaef-8f58-4719-9af6-34a5687a295a","pageSectionCanonId":"39dde494-13ff-491d-b53e-d59094a8f759","contentChunks":[{"pageContentChunkId":"e93975ec-1cd7-4079-84fc-1f9ae2e0a7c0","pageContentChunkCanonId":"7d74eff9-bff4-441e-8501-0bd570add456","htmlValue":"<h2 id=\"isPasted\">无障碍与 Material Design</h2><p><strong>默认无障碍</strong>是 Material 的核心设计价值。Material 的无障碍要求与目标记录在各组件页面和指南中。了解产品的无障碍特性可以提升所有用户的易用性，包括低视力、失明、听力障碍、认知障碍、行动障碍或情境性残障（例如手臂骨折）的用户。</p><p>无障碍标准内置于 Material 组件中，为包容性产品设计奠定了基础。预先考虑各种各样的人类体验与残障情况，可以避免代价高昂的重新设计，减少技术与设计债务，并在前期节约资源。</p>","footer":null,"imageUrl":null,"imageUrlFife":null,"imageHeight":null,"imageWidth":null,"altText":"","videoUrl":null,"videoHeight":null,"videoWidth":null,"codeUrl":null,"prototypeUrl":null,"resourceName":null,"libraryModuleType":null,"moduleConfigurationOverrides":null,"contentChunkType":"TEXT","crbHeight":500,"linkUrl":null,"openLinkUrlInNewWindow":true,"showBorderAroundMedia":false,"useSolidBackgroundOnMedia":true,"isControl":false,"captionModifier":null,"captionModifierCustomName":null,"flex":1,"autoplayVideo":null,"snippetCode":null,"snippetLanguage":null,"snippetLineNumbers":true,"updatedTimestamp":"2026-07-17T03:18:49.849Z"}]},{"pageContentBlockId":"75068669-360f-4bc9-8f5c-4ae35f3170fc","pageContentBlockCanonId":"262239f6-8c65-4540-84cc-44c771eede6a","isHidden":false,"isSqueezed":false,"title":null,"pageSectionId":"de49aaef-8f58-4719-9af6-34a5687a295a","pageSectionCanonId":"39dde494-13ff-491d-b53e-d59094a8f759","contentChunks":[{"pageContentChunkId":"e74a2b5f-d595-41b8-aff2-acf5f532b9d6","pageContentChunkCanonId":"549bc634-4cf9-4f2c-b05c-0d91d508b930","htmlValue":"<h2 id=\"isPasted\">无障碍设计的原则</h2><p>以下无障碍设计原则是一些方法，可以帮助你<strong>预见、包容并回应个人的需求</strong>。它们是设计、开发、协作和共创中的考量要点，能够带来包容且公平的结果。</p>","footer":null,"imageUrl":null,"imageUrlFife":null,"imageHeight":null,"imageWidth":null,"altText":"","videoUrl":null,"videoHeight":null,"videoWidth":null,"codeUrl":null,"prototypeUrl":null,"resourceName":null,"libraryModuleType":null,"moduleConfigurationOverrides":null,"contentChunkType":"TEXT","crbHeight":500,"linkUrl":null,"openLinkUrlInNewWindow":true,"showBorderAroundMedia":false,"useSolidBackgroundOnMedia":true,"isControl":false,"captionModifier":null,"captionModifierCustomName":null,"flex":1,"autoplayVideo":null,"snippetCode":null,"snippetLanguage":null,"snippetLineNumbers":true,"updatedTimestamp":"2026-07-17T03:18:49.758Z"}]},{"pageContentBlockId":"e5833039-f708-4c1d-bf6d-19171c0ea004","pageContentBlockCanonId":"12f61441-d993-4e98-913a-c3df83fef8ff","isHidden":false,"isSqueezed":false,"title":null,"pageSectionId":"de49aaef-8f58-4719-9af6-34a5687a295a","pageSectionCanonId":"39dde494-13ff-491d-b53e-d59094a8f759","contentChunks":[{"pageContentChunkId":"349d782a-e038-4e3e-aad6-5f4792a94f8f","pageContentChunkCanonId":"31b9eb46-3293-4355-af87-5390a2a673a1","htmlValue":"<h3 id=\"isPasted\">尊重个体</h3><p>通用的默认体验很少能满足每个人的需求。在默认体验中引入可自定义的功能，可以为个体调整留出空间。尊重任何人不断变化的需求，可能意味着给予他们更多自主选择的自由。</p><p>由于一个人在一天、一年乃至一生中的体验会不断变化，支持多样化的偏好与选择会很有帮助，让个体能够决定如何满足自己不断变化的状况、个人知识和多样化需求。 </p>","footer":null,"imageUrl":null,"imageUrlFife":null,"imageHeight":null,"imageWidth":null,"altText":"","videoUrl":null,"videoHeight":null,"videoWidth":null,"codeUrl":null,"prototypeUrl":null,"resourceName":null,"libraryModuleType":null,"moduleConfigurationOverrides":null,"contentChunkType":"TEXT","crbHeight":500,"linkUrl":null,"openLinkUrlInNewWindow":true,"showBorderAroundMedia":false,"useSolidBackgroundOnMedia":true,"isControl":false,"captionModifier":null,"captionModifierCustomName":null,"flex":1,"autoplayVideo":null,"snippetCode":null,"snippetLanguage":null,"snippetLineNumbers":true,"updatedTimestamp":"2026-07-17T03:18:49.759Z"},{"pageContentChunkId":"587d2188-44d8-42c7-b488-bc215bc28f15","pageContentChunkCanonId":"44eb516f-3388-4873-8fc4-eb29478cb5c8","htmlValue":null,"footer":"","imageUrl":"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/design-spec/o/projects%2Fgoogle-material-3%2Fimages%2Fl6qr2chf-l1yxwqsj-Google_AvatarProject-12_Final%201%20(1).png?alt=media&token=c3170438-686d-468a-8986-abd14605ce2b","imageUrlFife":null,"imageHeight":1004,"imageWidth":1004,"altText":"由彩色液体构成的人头部剪影","videoUrl":null,"videoHeight":null,"videoWidth":null,"codeUrl":null,"prototypeUrl":null,"resourceName":null,"libraryModuleType":null,"moduleConfigurationOverrides":null,"contentChunkType":"IMAGE","crbHeight":500,"linkUrl":null,"openLinkUrlInNewWindow":true,"showBorderAroundMedia":false,"useSolidBackgroundOnMedia":true,"isControl":false,"captionModifier":null,"captionModifierCustomName":null,"flex":1,"autoplayVideo":null,"snippetCode":null,"snippetLanguage":null,"snippetLineNumbers":true,"updatedTimestamp":"2026-07-17T03:18:49.759Z"}]},{"pageContentBlockId":"f4f6f6cf-f4c2-4b35-a081-7e47bb57be3f","pageContentBlockCanonId":"c6abce8b-c55d-42c2-be03-2574be127ad8","isHidden":false,"isSqueezed":false,"title":null,"pageSectionId":"de49aaef-8f58-4719-9af6-34a5687a295a","pageSectionCanonId":"39dde494-13ff-491d-b53e-d59094a8f759","contentChunks":[{"pageContentChunkId":"3f8c28a0-4410-4ba6-9bce-fd0d4607e75f","pageContentChunkCanonId":"1f7878d6-c2fd-49ba-81ff-2f13161ca987","htmlValue":"<h3 id=\"isPasted\">提前学习，而非事后补救</h3><p>在定义解决方案之前，先投入时间了解拥有广泛能力和生活经验的用户的需求。正式与非正式研究可以开辟新的思考方式，减少偏见，并鼓励以创造性的方式实现可访问性，尤其是惠及那些超出主流规范的人群。</p><p>无障碍设计流程会预先预判尽可能多的潜在产品或体验结果。当用户问题确实出现时，探索未曾预料的结果可以成为研究基础，帮助你学习、适应并从容应对。 </p>","footer":null,"imageUrl":null,"imageUrlFife":null,"imageHeight":null,"imageWidth":null,"altText":"","videoUrl":null,"videoHeight":null,"videoWidth":null,"codeUrl":null,"prototypeUrl":null,"resourceName":null,"libraryModuleType":null,"moduleConfigurationOverrides":null,"contentChunkType":"TEXT","crbHeight":500,"linkUrl":null,"openLinkUrlInNewWindow":true,"showBorderAroundMedia":false,"useSolidBackgroundOnMedia":true,"isControl":false,"captionModifier":null,"captionModifierCustomName":null,"flex":1,"autoplayVideo":null,"snippetCode":null,"snippetLanguage":null,"snippetLineNumbers":true,"updatedTimestamp":"2026-07-17T03:18:49.762Z"},{"pageContentChunkId":"bea6790a-8f6c-4358-bd58-4903216e6815","pageContentChunkCanonId":"eea835f1-7371-4a1f-a8af-da589d34635a","htmlValue":null,"footer":"","imageUrl":"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/design-spec/o/projects%2Fgoogle-material-3%2Fimages%2Fl6qr36jq-l1yxvjzc-Google_AvatarProject-4_Final%201%20(1).png?alt=media&token=376d8bc6-34aa-4433-abda-6050fb280a41","imageUrlFife":null,"imageHeight":1004,"imageWidth":1004,"altText":"漂浮在圆形孔洞上方的立方体","videoUrl":null,"videoHeight":null,"videoWidth":null,"codeUrl":null,"prototypeUrl":null,"resourceName":null,"libraryModuleType":null,"moduleConfigurationOverrides":null,"contentChunkType":"IMAGE","crbHeight":500,"linkUrl":null,"openLinkUrlInNewWindow":true,"showBorderAroundMedia":false,"useSolidBackgroundOnMedia":true,"isControl":false,"captionModifier":null,"captionModifierCustomName":null,"flex":1,"autoplayVideo":null,"snippetCode":null,"snippetLanguage":null,"snippetLineNumbers":true,"updatedTimestamp":"2026-07-17T03:18:49.762Z"}]},{"pageContentBlockId":"0e97b5de-fcce-4dd0-ae86-9fb31cd90715","pageContentBlockCanonId":"43d1b22e-1f80-4c40-aeca-d24e3568c418","isHidden":false,"isSqueezed":false,"title":null,"pageSectionId":"de49aaef-8f58-4719-9af6-34a5687a295a","pageSectionCanonId":"39dde494-13ff-491d-b53e-d59094a8f759","contentChunks":[{"pageContentChunkId":"05062650-9d42-4664-b6b5-ee12156a61f2","pageContentChunkCanonId":"cd01b95d-5e8f-419a-a19c-da544f4bad1c","htmlValue":"<h3>以要求为起点 </h3><p><a href=\"https://www.w3.org/WAI/standards-guidelines/wcag/\" target=\"_blank\"><u>WCAG</u></a> 规定的最低要求支持特定的人类需求。然而，这些要求也可以催生具有广泛益处的创造性解决方案。</p><p>历史表明，源于响应特定无障碍需求的功能（深色模式、文字转语音、语音转文字）是在既定约束内进行创造性问题解决的结果。将这些要求视为机遇而非约束，已被证明能带来最终惠及众多用户的解决方案。</p>","footer":null,"imageUrl":null,"imageUrlFife":null,"imageHeight":null,"imageWidth":null,"altText":"","videoUrl":null,"videoHeight":null,"videoWidth":null,"codeUrl":null,"prototypeUrl":null,"resourceName":null,"libraryModuleType":null,"moduleConfigurationOverrides":null,"contentChunkType":"TEXT","crbHeight":500,"linkUrl":null,"openLinkUrlInNewWindow":true,"showBorderAroundMedia":false,"useSolidBackgroundOnMedia":true,"isControl":false,"captionModifier":null,"captionModifierCustomName":null,"flex":1,"autoplayVideo":null,"snippetCode":null,"snippetLanguage":null,"snippetLineNumbers":true,"updatedTimestamp":"2026-07-17T03:18:49.866Z"},{"pageContentChunkId":"a1593cfe-f0f7-41aa-99ba-6a6a70dfe6df","pageContentChunkCanonId":"68183345-4853-44e9-ae7f-f967ff1f55ed","htmlValue":null,"footer":"","imageUrl":"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/design-spec/o/projects%2Fgoogle-material-3%2Fimages%2Fl6qr41s7-l1yxwaxg-Google_AvatarProject-1_Final%201%20(2).png?alt=media&token=7518c7a7-0f3a-4999-8953-532542edd129","imageUrlFife":null,"imageHeight":1004,"imageWidth":1004,"altText":"泡沫状材料雕刻成类似站立人形的拼图块","videoUrl":null,"videoHeight":null,"videoWidth":null,"codeUrl":null,"prototypeUrl":null,"resourceName":null,"libraryModuleType":null,"moduleConfigurationOverrides":null,"contentChunkType":"IMAGE","crbHeight":500,"linkUrl":null,"openLinkUrlInNewWindow":true,"showBorderAroundMedia":false,"useSolidBackgroundOnMedia":true,"isControl":false,"captionModifier":null,"captionModifierCustomName":null,"flex":1,"autoplayVideo":null,"snippetCode":null,"snippetLanguage":null,"snippetLineNumbers":true,"updatedTimestamp":"2026-07-17T03:18:49.866Z"}]}]},{"pageSectionId":"96389db0-e3c2-4766-85f2-80cac7189c23","pageSectionCanonId":"123486d3-7dc8-443b-a35b-340ea950316c","name":"辅助技术","position":1,"pageId":"2bf18b74-cba2-46ff-8fe0-f54c752943f6","pageCanonId":"4101047f-0a57-42f9-b537-2f1dcd7d1fa7","isVisible":true,"contentBlocks":[{"pageContentBlockId":"46e5044c-15c5-4051-b162-02dedf8687c1","pageContentBlockCanonId":"33a7174e-ca9e-4b3e-a459-c79d3a456113","isHidden":false,"isSqueezed":true,"title":null,"pageSectionId":"96389db0-e3c2-4766-85f2-80cac7189c23","pageSectionCanonId":"123486d3-7dc8-443b-a35b-340ea950316c","contentChunks":[{"pageContentChunkId":"aab36630-9a07-438b-ac02-3812e5be165c","pageContentChunkCanonId":"35887731-2ee5-4faf-9639-e152a8833187","htmlValue":"<h2 id=\"isPasted\">辅助技术</h2>","footer":null,"imageUrl":null,"imageUrlFife":null,"imageHeight":null,"imageWidth":null,"altText":"","videoUrl":null,"videoHeight":null,"videoWidth":null,"codeUrl":null,"prototypeUrl":null,"resourceName":null,"libraryModuleType":null,"moduleConfigurationOverrides":null,"contentChunkType":"TEXT","crbHeight":500,"linkUrl":null,"openLinkUrlInNewWindow":true,"showBorderAroundMedia":false,"useSolidBackgroundOnMedia":true,"isControl":false,"captionModifier":null,"captionModifierCustomName":null,"flex":1,"autoplayVideo":null,"snippetCode":null,"snippetLanguage":null,"snippetLineNumbers":true,"updatedTimestamp":"2026-07-17T03:18:49.765Z"}]},{"pageContentBlockId":"8919dc20-a049-4590-a4a8-5dad79f05198","pageContentBlockCanonId":"e3dd74fd-baaf-4ac9-b2bf-87b8e5b4bbb9","isHidden":false,"isSqueezed":true,"title":null,"pageSectionId":"96389db0-e3c2-4766-85f2-80cac7189c23","pageSectionCanonId":"123486d3-7dc8-443b-a35b-340ea950316c","contentChunks":[{"pageContentChunkId":"aa19023f-27d9-4d63-a3be-607bb7a98294","pageContentChunkCanonId":"86b9daab-2dfc-4167-a0a9-274faeb184d7","htmlValue":"<p>辅助技术有助于提高、维持或改善残障人士的功能能力。人们可以通过键盘、屏幕阅读器、盲文显示器等设备，以及输入追踪设备、放大镜和语音输入与技术交互，从而更加独立地生活。</p>","footer":null,"imageUrl":null,"imageUrlFife":null,"imageHeight":null,"imageWidth":null,"altText":"","videoUrl":null,"videoHeight":null,"videoWidth":null,"codeUrl":null,"prototypeUrl":null,"resourceName":null,"libraryModuleType":null,"moduleConfigurationOverrides":null,"contentChunkType":"TEXT","crbHeight":500,"linkUrl":null,"openLinkUrlInNewWindow":true,"showBorderAroundMedia":false,"useSolidBackgroundOnMedia":true,"isControl":false,"captionModifier":null,"captionModifierCustomName":null,"flex":1,"autoplayVideo":null,"snippetCode":null,"snippetLanguage":null,"snippetLineNumbers":true,"updatedTimestamp":"2026-07-17T03:18:49.765Z"},{"pageContentChunkId":"58025489-3420-405e-9767-9cf2dffaf3dd","pageContentChunkCanonId":"95e8ce5b-33e3-441e-b8f0-32484c668fe0","htmlValue":null,"footer":"图标是需要理解不同输入方式和用户需求的交互元素的一个例子。在本示例中，图标的目标区域被标识出来，以展示扩展后的图标周边区域如何让操作的交互更易于进行。","imageUrl":"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/design-spec/o/projects%2Fgoogle-material-3%2Fimages%2Fm0qv6git-3-3p.png?alt=media&token=58747de8-c1f4-4f0d-8b47-50b05385a705","imageUrlFife":null,"imageHeight":600,"imageWidth":1352,"altText":"图标示例，标示出超出图标实际尺寸的目标尺寸","videoUrl":null,"videoHeight":null,"videoWidth":null,"codeUrl":null,"prototypeUrl":null,"resourceName":null,"libraryModuleType":null,"moduleConfigurationOverrides":null,"contentChunkType":"IMAGE","crbHeight":500,"linkUrl":null,"openLinkUrlInNewWindow":true,"showBorderAroundMedia":true,"useSolidBackgroundOnMedia":true,"isControl":false,"captionModifier":null,"captionModifierCustomName":null,"flex":2,"autoplayVideo":null,"snippetCode":null,"snippetLanguage":null,"snippetLineNumbers":true,"updatedTimestamp":"2026-07-17T03:18:49.765Z"}]},{"pageContentBlockId":"40673fbb-0d27-4b60-ade7-4753aed2a9fe","pageContentBlockCanonId":"ec6f3e84-a51c-4dc0-a353-6844f5bde698","isHidden":false,"isSqueezed":true,"title":null,"pageSectionId":"96389db0-e3c2-4766-85f2-80cac7189c23","pageSectionCanonId":"123486d3-7dc8-443b-a35b-340ea950316c","contentChunks":[{"pageContentChunkId":"f4050cc6-1165-474e-a964-f4c86d369bed","pageContentChunkCanonId":"22dd197a-8a48-4fb7-a1f7-9b4b7fcfc4ab","htmlValue":"<h3 id=\"isPasted\">常见的辅助技术形式</h3>","footer":null,"imageUrl":null,"imageUrlFife":null,"imageHeight":null,"imageWidth":null,"altText":"","videoUrl":null,"videoHeight":null,"videoWidth":null,"codeUrl":null,"prototypeUrl":null,"resourceName":null,"libraryModuleType":null,"moduleConfigurationOverrides":null,"contentChunkType":"TEXT","crbHeight":500,"linkUrl":null,"openLinkUrlInNewWindow":true,"showBorderAroundMedia":false,"useSolidBackgroundOnMedia":true,"isControl":false,"captionModifier":null,"captionModifierCustomName":null,"flex":1,"autoplayVideo":null,"snippetCode":null,"snippetLanguage":null,"snippetLineNumbers":true,"updatedTimestamp":"2026-07-17T03:18:49.766Z"}]},{"pageContentBlockId":"f5d8236d-6406-43f3-8e41-d5b2fa761fb7","pageContentBlockCanonId":"ed45ce24-290a-4907-bd8a-1ce474ca0062","isHidden":false,"isSqueezed":false,"title":null,"pageSectionId":"96389db0-e3c2-4766-85f2-80cac7189c23","pageSectionCanonId":"123486d3-7dc8-443b-a35b-340ea950316c","contentChunks":[{"pageContentChunkId":"231cf856-bed2-4b61-8fc4-54576a205114","pageContentChunkCanonId":"f55a08a2-77fa-4b31-b493-6d9afae2edaf","htmlValue":"<h4><strong>键盘</strong></h4><p>键盘、D-pad 或轨迹球等硬件或软件方向控制器，让用户能够以线性方式从一个选择跳到下一个选择。</p><h4><strong>屏幕阅读器</strong></h4><p>屏幕阅读器是一种软件程序，它使用盲文显示器或朗读文本，例如 Google 的屏幕阅读器 TalkBack。有视觉障碍、阅读困难或暂时无法阅读的人可能会使用屏幕阅读器。屏幕阅读器会将可见内容转化为语音并朗读出来。段落和按钮文本，以及图标和标题的替代文本等隐藏内容，都会被程序识别。你可以为内容添加标签，以优化屏幕阅读器用户或使用纯文本版 UI 用户的体验。</p><h4><strong>开关输入</strong></h4><p>开关会扫描屏幕上的项目，依次高亮显示每个项目，直到你做出选择。Switch Access 让你可以使用一个或多个开关（而非触摸屏）与 Android 设备交互。 </p>","footer":null,"imageUrl":null,"imageUrlFife":null,"imageHeight":null,"imageWidth":null,"altText":"","videoUrl":null,"videoHeight":null,"videoWidth":null,"codeUrl":null,"prototypeUrl":null,"resourceName":null,"libraryModuleType":null,"moduleConfigurationOverrides":null,"contentChunkType":"TEXT","crbHeight":500,"linkUrl":null,"openLinkUrlInNewWindow":true,"showBorderAroundMedia":false,"useSolidBackgroundOnMedia":true,"isControl":false,"captionModifier":null,"captionModifierCustomName":null,"flex":1,"autoplayVideo":null,"snippetCode":null,"snippetLanguage":null,"snippetLineNumbers":true,"updatedTimestamp":"2026-07-17T03:18:49.888Z"}]}]}]}